  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\nOften used in the form {突発|とっぱつ}{的|てき}(な) as a な-adjective meaning \"sudden\" or \"unexpected.\" Can also be used as a noun or with する.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {突発|とっぱつ}{的|てき}な{事故|じこ} (sudden accident)\n- {突発|とっぱつ}{的|てき}な{事態|じたい} (unexpected situation)\n- {突発|とっぱつ}{事故|じこ} (sudden accident)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {突然|とつぜん}: suddenly (adverb, more common in everyday speech)\n- {急|きゅう}: sudden, abrupt (broader usage)",
